  "summary": "Trying to figure out how to market your business on the internet? Is your existing website actually helping you grow?\n\nFor your business to succeed, you need a web-savvy partner that is genuinely interested in helping grow your business by helping future customers find out about your business on the internet. A home, a brand presence, a way to inform people, convert them to customers, and keep them engaged.\n\nI'm Eric Sassaman from Bellevue, WA. I can help you with that. Check out my websites below, and visit http://sastech.click for more info.",
