    "totalDuration": "18 yrs 2 mos",
    "employmentType": "Self-employed",
    "description": "If you don't have a website, you don't exist. If your existing website is old, it needs updating. I can help you with that. \n\n* I'm easy to work with. Communication is key.\n* You will always get honest advice, even if that means do it yourself and not hire me!\n* There's a gazillion ways to create a website. You'll get advice on the best solution for you.\n\nHow does it work? I'll help you navigate this complicated process:\n\n* Let's hang out. Teach me all about your business and your dreams.\n* We discover, simplify, and clarify the things most important to you.\n* I'll give you some potential solutions and directions to go. We toss some ideas around.\n* When everything looks good, construction begins!\n\n\"The unknown really breeds fear. This whole area of the internet and websites is not my area of expertise. So I wasn’t totally comfortable at first since I didn’t know where we were going or what we could do. But Eric made it easy. His attitude was always very positive. Eric not only provided the technical expertise, but had the aesthetic designer ‘gene’ going on, so he was the total package. So that made it easy to trust him. His personality and humbleness just took the fear away.”\n- Robert Case, Head Pastor, Calvary Chapel Eastside\n\nContact me for some simple, easy advice, I'd be glad to point you in the right direction to setting up your own website. Go to http://sastech.click to find out more and contact me.",
